   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "The next morning, back in the mayor's office. Last time, Arkady named a humiliating condition for the job, a silly kiss, to pay Samson back for his childhood, and Samson stormed out. Now Arkady is in a fine mood: he orders coffee, and his deputy Pasha comes in with news and a big money idea. Let's listen in Russian first.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Какое хорошее утро! Лидия Алексеевна, чашку кофе, пожалуйста.",
