  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Вот поэтому ты и не на моём месте.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's go through it slowly. It's a sunny morning, and Arkady is very pleased with himself.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
