   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Хорошо. А что с торговым центром?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Good. And what about the shopping centre?' The phrase ",
