   "t": "Три дня ему даём. Всё.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We give him three days. That's it.' The action word for 'we give', ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "даём",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": ", lays down an ultimatum, sealed by the crisp word for 'that's final', ",
