  },
  {
   "v": "arkady",
   "t": "Посмотри, какой у нас город прекрасный. Озёра, луга.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Look what a beautiful town we have. Lakes, meadows.' The town name is built from 'blue lakes', matching the words for 'lakes', ",
